1
00:00:08,125 --> 00:00:09,675
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,050 --> 00:00:12,200
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:14,975 --> 00:00:17,884
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,431
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,825 --> 00:00:28,329
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,329 --> 00:00:30,569
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,575 --> 00:00:35,465
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:39,798
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,425 --> 00:00:44,201
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:49,375
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,375 --> 00:00:53,023
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,825 --> 00:00:58,332
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,332 --> 00:01:01,980
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,459 --> 00:01:09,416
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,248 --> 00:01:15,768
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,768 --> 00:01:18,442
=Episode 19=

17
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:27,680
Same as always.

18
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,879
Move half of it,

19
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:32,200
and send the other half
to the warehouse.

20
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,280
Bao Zun will pick it up.

21
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:34,159
Got it.

22
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:35,560
Boss Liu.

23
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:36,840
Boss Liu.

24
00:01:37,359 --> 00:01:37,920
Boss Liu.

25
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:39,480
Boss Liu.

26
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:40,840
Someone left this for you.

27
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,640
What is it?

28
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:43,519
No idea.

29
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:53,359
What is it?

30
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,079
Boss Lin.

31
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,079
We found it.

32
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,040
Fei Liu got a new warehouse a month ago.

33
00:02:03,319 --> 00:02:04,120
It's over on Anlan Alley.

34
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,640
You sure?

35
00:02:06,319 --> 00:02:07,599
Dazui and Tidao have been watching it.

36
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,879
They saw Fei Liu's men

37
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:11,000
drop off a shipment.

38
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,639
Let's go check it out.

39
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:21,800
But, Boss Liu,

40
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,159
the shot-caller election is tomorrow.

41
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:25,159
Shen Yanlin can't do much now.

42
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:28,280
You think Shen Yanlin had
Bao Zun killed?

43
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:29,879
When it came to moving the goods,

44
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,120
besides Dongshan Tai,

45
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,800
Bao Zun and I knew the most.

46
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,360
Boss Tai did it?

47
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:39,280
Tai may look mild-mannered,

48
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,400
but when it comes to ruthlessness,

49
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:43,039
no one in Dongcheng Gang comes close.

50
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,520
(Build Deep, Embrace All)
As long as I'm alive,

51
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:46,919
Dongshan Tai

52
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,360
won't rest easy.

53
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:50,919
Hurry. Get the car ready.

54
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,400
Okay.

55
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:18,000
Alright, alright.

56
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:26,000
Doesn't this place seem
a little underguarded?

57
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,240
Fei Liu's headquarters is nearby.

58
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,400
Search the place.

59
00:03:32,029 --> 00:03:32,400
Move.

60
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:41,919
Nothing.

61
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,120
Over here.

62
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,840
Check every inch.

63
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,024
Got it.

64
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:54,960
Nothing here.

65
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:58,919
Boss Lin!

66
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,360
- Nothing.
- Boss Lin.

67
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,319
We didn't find anything.

68
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:02,919
Finish searching this side.

69
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:04,439
- Keep looking.
- Got it.

70
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:07,639
That old fox Dongshan Tai

71
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,624
must've hidden the drugs

72
00:04:08,625 --> 00:04:09,879
inside something.

73
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,280
Stop!

74
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:15,639
Boss Lin.

75
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,199
We spotted Fei Liu.

76
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:19,000
Dongshan Tai's men are chasing him.

77
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,240
Dongshan Tai's men are after Fei Liu?

78
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:24,560
Let's go.

79
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:25,759
To protect Boss Liu.

80
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:28,319
Go! Go!

81
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,279
Go check it out.

82
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,240
Stop!

83
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:40,519
Don't run!

84
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,839
Boss Tai sends his regards, Boss Liu.

85
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:52,519
Dongshan Tai broke our rules

86
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,519
and showed no respect

87
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,519
Dongcheng Gang has no place for him.

88
00:04:57,439 --> 00:04:57,839
Beat him!

89
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:06,879
Stop!

90
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:08,639
Please stop!

91
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:10,920
I'll pay!

92
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,639
I'll give you money!

93
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:12,360
Please.

94
00:05:12,519 --> 00:05:12,920
Don't hit me.

95
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,160
Money. Money.

96
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:15,959
Money.

97
00:05:17,279 --> 00:05:18,399
Hand it over!

98
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:19,680
Hurry up!

99
00:05:20,399 --> 00:05:21,000
What are you doing?

100
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:23,600
Don't run!

101
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,560
Stop! After him!

102
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:28,680
Don't run! Stop!

103
00:05:28,885 --> 00:05:30,253
Stop! Don't run!

104
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:32,800
Boss Liu.

105
00:05:33,959 --> 00:05:35,319
How'd you end up like this?

106
00:05:36,319 --> 00:05:38,000
That scumbag Dongshan Tai...

107
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:39,399
he thinks

108
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,439
the shot-caller position
will be his for sure,

109
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:42,560
so now that

110
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,759
he's used me, he wants to get rid of me.

111
00:05:46,519 --> 00:05:47,439
He killed Bao Zun.

112
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:48,639
And now

113
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:51,079
he won't rest until I'm dead too.

114
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:58,399
If Dongshan Tai wants you dead,

115
00:05:59,639 --> 00:06:01,600
he'll have every route out
of the country blocked.

116
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:03,914
Boss Mai and Boss Men

117
00:06:03,915 --> 00:06:05,240
have been on his side for a long time.

118
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,079
We're the only two who can save you now.

119
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,439
That's right, Boss Liu.

120
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,399
I could save you this time,

121
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:14,600
but I can't promise
there'll be a next time.

122
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:15,759
Really difficult.

123
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:20,759
Just say what you want.

124
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,720
I want to know

125
00:06:25,319 --> 00:06:27,240
why Dongshan Tai would need you dead

126
00:06:27,839 --> 00:06:28,839
once he becomes the shot-caller.

127
00:06:42,759 --> 00:06:43,680
I just can't stand

128
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,279
your generation

129
00:06:46,439 --> 00:06:47,800
throwing your weight around.

130
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,680
But compared to Dongshan Tai,

131
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,240
I'd rather have you as the shot-caller.

132
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:59,560
I'll take that.

133
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,800
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)
Bao'd been with Tai since he was young.

134
00:07:04,839 --> 00:07:06,720
I never thought Dongshan Tai
would kill him too.

135
00:07:12,399 --> 00:07:13,036
Sometimes,

136
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:15,160
the people closest to you

137
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:16,920
may be friend or foe.

138
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,800
You can never really tell.

139
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:28,560
What's so fun about this thing?

140
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:37,160
What's in Fei Liu's ledger?

141
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,839
It records when and how much product

142
00:07:39,839 --> 00:07:41,800
he and Dongshan Tai moved,

143
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,480
plus some of their biggest distributors.

144
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,360
Then we were right.

145
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,800
The Yaba

146
00:07:50,279 --> 00:07:52,319
was moving through Fei Liu's
shipping routes.

147
00:07:55,519 --> 00:07:57,319
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)
But what's in this ledger alone

148
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:59,040
isn't enough to tie the drug operation

149
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,439
to Dongshan Tai.

150
00:08:02,639 --> 00:08:04,240
And now that he knows Fei Liu got away,

151
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,759
he'll only be more careful.

152
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,500
I think we'll have to wait

153
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,720
until after the shot-caller election

154
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,399
and figure something out then.

155
00:08:13,519 --> 00:08:13,920
Alright.

156
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,800
What about Fei Liu?

157
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,079
What are you going to do with him?

158
00:08:24,439 --> 00:08:25,560
What do you want me to do?

159
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,639
I know you hate him,

160
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:34,600
but he was just on the other side.

161
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,399
That's how gang wars work.

162
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,000
You know what I'm saying.

163
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,480
Don't worry.

164
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,639
I've already arranged

165
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,399
to get him out of Shicheng.

166
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:53,279
Let's go.

167
00:08:54,120 --> 00:09:00,000
(Zhongkai Seafood Restaurant)

168
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,399
(Excuse me.)

169
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:57,720
Miss.

170
00:09:58,679 --> 00:09:59,879
This fabric is too nice.

171
00:10:00,919 --> 00:10:02,440
You really shouldn't have gone
to the expense.

172
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:03,919
Only fabric this fine

173
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,650
is good enough

174
00:10:04,651 --> 00:10:06,480
for the future shot-caller.

175
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,840
You're too kind, Miss.

176
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:11,679
Boss Tai.

177
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:12,879
Miss,

178
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:14,960
would you give us a moment?

179
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,039
I'll come find you in a bit.

180
00:10:16,159 --> 00:10:16,799
Of course, Boss Tai.

181
00:10:20,799 --> 00:10:22,000
Boss Liu had a heart attack.

182
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,279
He's dead.

183
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:28,919
A heart attack. How convenient.

184
00:10:31,159 --> 00:10:31,679
Where's the ledger?

185
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,092
As soon as I heard,

186
00:10:33,093 --> 00:10:33,960
I went looking for it.

187
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:36,279
But Boss Liu didn't have it.

188
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,159
And the first shipment

189
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:40,200
is already on the move.

190
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,720
It's probably too late to intercept it.

191
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:43,960
No.

192
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:47,799
I don't care how you do it.

193
00:10:47,799 --> 00:10:48,919
Stop that shipment.

194
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,399
Take it somewhere safe

195
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,960
and burn it all.

196
00:10:52,559 --> 00:10:53,000
And

197
00:10:54,159 --> 00:10:55,240
the stuff we still have

198
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,639
can't be distributed either.

199
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:58,279
Remember,

200
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,159
none of that stuff

201
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:03,639
can ever be traced back to us.

202
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,519
Understood, Boss Tai.

203
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,440
Go.

204
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:21,919
Even though

205
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,440
the shot-caller election was postponed,

206
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:26,720
the result won't change.

207
00:11:29,159 --> 00:11:30,039
Should we

208
00:11:30,519 --> 00:11:32,159
go have tea with Tai?

209
00:11:34,519 --> 00:11:37,399
Never heard of Fei Liu
having heart problems.

210
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,600
And of all times,

211
00:11:41,159 --> 00:11:42,639
it happens now.

212
00:11:46,519 --> 00:11:47,879
It's supposed to rain today.

213
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:51,240
Looks like a bad day to go out.

214
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:02,840
(Loyalty)

215
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,000
What happened to Fei Liu...

216
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,720
was that you?

217
00:12:11,799 --> 00:12:12,679
(Build Deep, Embrace All)
Boss Liu.

218
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,480
What is it?

219
00:12:14,919 --> 00:12:15,600
Can we go?

220
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,960
I want to ask you something.

221
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:20,919
What?

222
00:12:22,279 --> 00:12:23,320
Were you the one

223
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:24,463
who planted Boss Hai's steel plate

224
00:12:24,464 --> 00:12:25,960
at Boss Hui's pig farm?

225
00:12:31,440 --> 00:12:33,760
(Build Deep, Embrace All)

226
00:12:34,919 --> 00:12:35,720
That steel plate

227
00:12:36,759 --> 00:12:38,759
was planted by Dongshan Tai.

228
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:40,879
He followed every lead he could,

229
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,360
but couldn't find the killer.

230
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:44,759
So

231
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,080
he decided

232
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:48,360
to frame Hui instead.

233
00:13:01,039 --> 00:13:02,480
What about Boss Hui's wife and kid?

234
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,360
Did you kill them?

235
00:13:10,300 --> 00:13:15,120
(Build Deep, Embrace All)

236
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,160
(Build Deep, Embrace All)

237
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,480
Send Boss Liu on his way.

238
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:25,919
Hey! What are you doing?

239
00:13:26,759 --> 00:13:27,360
Give me the medicine!

240
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,240
Give me the medicine!

241
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:29,919
No!

242
00:13:42,480 --> 00:13:44,600
(Build Deep, Embrace All)

243
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,519
What did you give me?

244
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:47,000
You'll find out soon enough.

245
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:53,840
You...

246
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:16,799
You suspect me?

247
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:23,480
(Dongcheng Tiger)

248
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,480
If I wanted him dead,

249
00:14:25,159 --> 00:14:26,200
why would I have saved him?

250
00:14:35,919 --> 00:14:36,440
Boss Che.

251
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:38,736
Whether we can take Dongshan Tai down

252
00:14:38,737 --> 00:14:39,679
comes down to the next three days.

253
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,559
Take a look at this.

254
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,360
It all depends on whether

255
00:14:44,840 --> 00:14:46,360
we can tie Fei Liu's drug operation

256
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,440
to Dongshan Tai.

257
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,399
This ledger records

258
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,799
every shipment in and out.

259
00:15:11,519 --> 00:15:12,679
But the numbers don't add up.

260
00:15:13,279 --> 00:15:13,679
Look.

261
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,799
Just look at the numbers.

262
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:17,720
Incoming.

263
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:19,639
Outgoing.

264
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,480
Half the shipment is missing.

265
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:31,960
When we searched Fei Liu's warehouse,

266
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,960
none of it was there either.

267
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,240
Which means

268
00:15:38,159 --> 00:15:41,159
Fei Liu only handled transport
and distribution.

269
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:45,600
The drugs belong to Dongshan Tai.

270
00:15:48,759 --> 00:15:49,612
The ledger

271
00:15:49,612 --> 00:15:50,519
also records

272
00:15:50,519 --> 00:15:51,740
when each shipment arrived at the port

273
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:52,720
and the dates,

274
00:15:53,206 --> 00:15:54,200
but there's no fixed schedule.

275
00:15:56,360 --> 00:15:57,368
It's usually

276
00:15:57,368 --> 00:15:58,712
every ten to fifteen days.

277
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:01,159
Bao Zun and Fei Liu are both dead,

278
00:16:01,159 --> 00:16:02,720
but someone still has
to receive the shipments.

279
00:16:05,399 --> 00:16:06,799
So if we keep a close eye on the docks,

280
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,480
we might find out

281
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:11,600
where Dongshan Tai is hiding the drugs.
